<title>ISRAEL: Netanyahu says decision proves he did no wrong.</title>
<headline>Netanyahu says decision proves he did no wrong.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu welcomed a decision by Israeli prosecutors not to charge him in a corruption scandal on Sunday, saying he had been vindicated.</p>
<p>&quot;The bottom line is I didn't commit any crime, and the attorney general confirmed that,&quot; he said in a televised speech.</p>
</text>
